From 0a7360d4a4f4bb3358644ea1fdff217c40784958 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 13:10:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Expose coherent tile-image framebuffer-fetch contracts

Add real dynamic-rendering and tile-image color-read capability queries and descriptor-free attachment metadata. Existing pipelines leave the new attachment list empty; emission is added separately. Cache schema and public API inventory cover the added vocabulary. Source reviewed; subsequent compiler and runtime changes run focused build and structural checks.
